@local-minimum @AThousandShips This issue is resolvable with a GDScript adjustment.

PackedScene.instantiate takes an optional parameter, [Enum Gen_Edit_State](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_packedscene.html#enum-packedscene-geneditstate) for specifying the level of detail with which the new node should be instantiated. This parameter is optional and defaults to Gen_Edit_State_Disabled, but the other options are useful for tool scripts like this one that are adding nodes to our editor tree.

In this case, the correct parameter is Gen_Edit_State_Instance, and testing the same tool behavior with said parameter produces correct and consistent behavior.
